<title>USA: Ariel names Brian Hoerl president.</title>
<headline>Ariel names Brian Hoerl president.</headline>
<dateline>CRANBURY, N.J. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ariel Corp said on Thursday it named Brian Hoerl company president in addition to his title as chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Ariel Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Anthony Agnello had held the position, the company said.  </p>
<p>Hoerl, 41, joined Ariel in November 1993 as vice president of sales. He was promoted to the job of chief operating officer earlier this year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
